window.products.push({"id":1153017,"name":"HOOBRO C-Shaped End Table, Tempered Glass Couch Table with Metal Frame, Narrow Snack Side Table for Small Space, Living Room, Bedroom, Modern and Simp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51R8AwqIt+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Simple and Stylish: This C-shaped end table uses a gold fashion metal frame with a transparent tempered glass top, exuding a unique appeal among many similar products. The entire sofa table showcases our design proposition of purity, sophistication and concision. The stylish look allows the side table to easily integrate into the existing home Firm Construction, Stable Use: This gold nightstand in C shape features steadiness and sturdiness with the thickened tempered glass and selected metal bars. The top’s maximum static load is 22 lb, which is sufficient to bear and protect your favorite albums or art ornaments. The triangular corner enhancer is an unique plus for your storage and enables this TV tray table to accompany you longer Changing Roles in Diverse Scenes: Measuring 11.8 x 15.7 x 24.4 inches, this narrow sofa table takes up little floor space and is perfect for placing on the edge of the sofa or bed, for computers, snacks or the usual remote control. Even it is not in use, you can slide its bottom under the sofa without taking up extra space and change it into an ornament Leveling Feet, Non-Slip and Noiseless: We have equipped this golden sofa side table with 4 adjustable feet and 4 non-slip pads, which not only keep you away from the trouble of shaking the side table caused by uneven floors, but also when you move the slim side table to the desired position, there will be no scratches on the floor or blanket, and there will be no unpleasant noise. We really value your usage experience Clear Structure, Easy to Care: Simple in structure and pure in color, you can figure out the assembly process of this gold sofa table quickly. Plus the detailed instructions, clearly labeled parts and required tools, the installation is a piece of a cake. The user-friendly shape allows you to touch each corner without any obstruction, saving your effort to clean regularly. Perhaps you really need this C-shaped side table to update your monotonous home design","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51R8AwqIt+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOOBRO","source_asin":"B0C4D57BGV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1153017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4D57BGV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4D57BGV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
