window.products.push({"id":1153243,"name":"Yaheetech 7.5Ft Pre-Lit Pre-Decorated Artificial Hinged Christmas Tree with Foldable Stand Hinged Spray White Snow Flocked Xmas Tree with 90 Red Berri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cwlG6BDRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High-Quality Materials】All branches and tips are made of premium PVC, while the tree trunk and stand are made of sturdy metal. Bendable “leaves” are not likely to fall off, which leaves you a clean floor surface after usage. Nicely sprayed “snow” are tightly attached to branch tips as well. It is also assured that the branches and tips are fire-resistant and strong enough to hold extra ornaments. 【Clear Warm Lights】Our Christmas tree has ample incandescent warm white lights so you do not need to add extra lights. Nicely scattered lights are in a clear warm tone, transferring coziness and happiness to your room through the whole holidays. 【Sturdy & Foldable Stand】The metal stand is wide enough to keep balance and sturdy enough to hold a full tree body, not to mention all lights and other ornaments you feel like putting on. The four legs of this stand are carefully equipped with rubber to make sure it does not slide on floors. The foldable feature is for easy storage and packing, the materials are capable of reusing. 【Easy to Set Up】The tree body is divided into 3 sections with labels on them. You could set up this tree by simply inserting one part on another. The stand can also be effortlessly connected to the tree body with screws. It is suggested to wear gloves while setting up and fluffing out, just like real spruce, the “needles” can be a bit scratchy. 【Versatile Design】Our frosted pre-lit artificial tree can be used either indoors or outdoors, the sturdy metal frame is relatively heavier and not likely to collapse. It is a pre-lit tree with no decoration except for the branches and prefixed red berries. We hope you can enjoy a sweet fun time decorating this full and natural-looked tree with your family and beloved ones.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cwlG6BDRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yaheetech","source_asin":"B08MKJFMQN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1153243","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MKJFMQN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MKJFMQN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
