window.products.push({"id":1153401,"name":"Unbleached Parchment Paper Roll for Baking, 2 Pack of 15 In X 210 Ft Non-stick Baking Parchment Paper, Food Grade Cooking Paper for Baking Bread, Cook","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IDjc1P4oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUITABLE FOR ANY BAKEWARE: Do you love baking but often bothered by the size deviation between parchment paper and baking tray? Baklicious parchment paper for baking are 15 in x 210 ft, 260 square feet x 2 in total. You can crop any size what you want by using baking paper roll. NON-STICK BAKING PAPER FOR OVEN: Our nonstick parchment paper roll for baking easily release your stickiest food without sticking it to the baking pan. Most food items conveniently slide off from the baking tray and you just need to remove the brown parchment paper. These non-sticky baking paper also exclude any inconvenience of using oil or sprays for perfect baking. FOOD GRADE AND NON-TOXIC: These are certified food safe that means no components from the parchment paper unbleached ever migrate to food, nor its impact the flavor or texture of your food. Besides, with these non-toxic food grade baking parchment roll, you don’t need to worry about leaching either. These cooking parchment paper is 100% unbleached, oven safe, non-toxic and BPA free. HIGH QUALITY & THICK: Our parchment paper cooking is thick so moist foods will not soak through it when cooking and it’s strong enough to handle transferring your cookies from pan to cooling rack. MULTIPLE-PURPOSE: With a temperature resistance ranging from -68 to 425 degrees Fahrenheit, our 15 inch parchment paper can be also used in the toaster oven, refrigerator and microwave oven.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IDjc1P4oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BAKLICIOUS","source_asin":"B09T6VR4CT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1153401","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T6VR4CT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T6VR4CT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1153402,"name":"10 Pack Dishwasher Safe Reusable Bags Silicone, Leakproof Reusable Freezer Bags, BPA Free Reusable Food Storage Bags for Lunch Marinate Food Travel - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ovlHWeCzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[DISHWASHER SAFE] Why bother with hand washing the reusable bags when you have a dishwasher? Thanks to innovative upgrades to materials, our reusable food storage bags are dishwasher safe. Simply turn the reusable bag inside out and put it in the dishwasher for easy cleaning. However, please skip high-temperature functions such as the dishwasher's drying to extend the lifespan of the bag. [FOOD GRADE MATERIAL & FREEZER SAFE] Our reusable freezer bags are made out of 100% food-grade PEVA that's free of BPA. Low-temperature resistant material makes the bag freezer safe. They prevent your food from freezer burn while preserving its flavor, perfect for freezing meat, fish, shrimp, and vegetables. [LEAKPROOF & AIRTIGHT] These reusable lunch bags will give you absolute confidence to hold liquids or sauces. Because they are 100% leakproof. The double-seal design keeps liquids and air locked inside. At the same time, the airtight function of reusable food bags will keep food fresh longer. Everyone can easily open and close the bag. [ECO FRIENDLY & ECONOMICAL] Our reusable gallon bags are reusable and recyclable, one of our bags can reduce the use of 450 single-use plastic bags, which has a significant environmental impact. At the same time, the reusable bag is also a more economical option for your household. [MUTI-USE & 100% SATISFACTION] 3 reusable gallon bags are great for marinating meat, frozen food, office supplies, 4 reusable sandwich bags are perfect containers for sandwiches, lunches, stationery, travel toiletries, 3 reusable snack bags are perfect for storing snacks and fruits, family organization. If you are not 100% satisfied with your reusable bags, feel free to contact us for solutions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ovlHWeCzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lerine","source_asin":"B0B5Q6VJ2L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1153402","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5Q6VJ2L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5Q6VJ2L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
