window.products.push({"id":1153440,"name":"labworkauto 5 Tiers Corner Wall Shelf Wood Square Shelf Corner Bookshelf Living Room Bed Room (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":74.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CgjuhjcTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This listing is optional for Black, white and burlywood. Specifications: Material: MDF Height of each layer: 7.87\" (20cm) Item Weight:  8.37 lb Overall Dimensions: 7.87 * 7.87 * 48.03 Features: Installation is quick and easy, the mounting instructions and hanging hardware is included. Make sure that the storage shelf and organizer unit is mounted flush to the surface of the wall. Large storage potential, can display Photos, CDs, Toys, Medals and more. Space saving, store your essential items, knick knacks, treasured items and other essentials on the two tiers. No more searching for your items, they are easy to reach and conveniently displayed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CgjuhjcTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"labworkauto","source_asin":"B094VV2JQ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1153440","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094VV2JQ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094VV2JQ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1153441,"name":"downluxe Premium Down Feather Pillow Luxury Hotel Collection - Bed Pillow for Sleeping with Silver Piped Edges, Queen Size (20\"×28\", Pack of 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61thUKe-ZRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MEDIUM FIRM SUPPORT】- Filled with 60% feathers and 40% polyester, these feather pillow inserts have soft feeling and provide medium firm support for head and neck. Feathers ensure the pillow's softness and polyester provides support, which can avoid the shortcomings of feather pillow's too soft and down alternative pillow's too hard. 【ITEM SIZE & DESIGN】- Feather pillow measures 20x28 inches. Our feather down pillow is finished with decorative silver piped edges that gives the pillow a beautiful looking and prevent feather and down from shedding. 【SOFT COVER】- Our pillow down is encased in a high-density down-proof polyester cover which is breathable and skin-friendly. Unique fabric avoids feathers poking your face and fine needle stitching ensures durability, which can offer you a comfortable sleeping experience. 【HOW TO USE】- Upon receipt, please push the down feather pillow insert in and out on all four sides and put them in a ventilated place for 1-2 days to make pillow feather return to the original shape. Bathing it in the sun for several hours is recommended for a healthier use. 【CARE INSTRUCTION】- Machine washable in cold water with gentle cycle, tumble dry low when needed. We recommend that you use a pillowcase when using down and feather pillow. Pat the pillow every day after getting up and ventilate the pillow every 3-4 weeks to keep the pillow fluffy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61thUKe-ZRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"downluxe","source_asin":"B0BZDDZKZN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1153441","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZDDZKZN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZDDZKZN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
