window.products.push({"id":1153513,"name":"Tovolo Flex-Core Long-Handled Silicone Jar Scraper Spatula, Wood Handle, Heat-Resistant Silicone Head With Curved Front for Scooping & Scraping, Dishw","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.34,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nQkq6RykL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Clean out your jars completely with Tovolo’s Long-Handled Silicone Jar Scraper Spatula With Wood Handle. Long, narrow head fits into small jars, and the angled head ensures you can reach into corners to scoop out every last bit of your peanut butter, jelly, jam, preserves, nut butter, mayonnaise, condiments, and more. Head is curved slightly to help scoop out your food; flattened back spreads your nut butters and condiments evenly. The head also features a curved shoulder where it meets the long handle, which is designed to swipe smoothly along the lip of a jar, getting every last bit. Completely smooth silicone surface allows for even spreading, and edges are tapered to a sharp point to scrape sides clean. Wooden handle adds an air of traditionalism to the modern silicone spatula. The ergonomic handle is designed to fit comfortably in hand as you mix, fold, scrape, spread, flip, and serve. The wood is tough, durable, and thick enough to tackle your toughest kitchen jobs. Silicone head is reinforced with a sturdy nylon core for rigidity and strength. This combination offers a solid core that can tackle thick batters and hearty doughs while the flexible edges provide just enough give to scrape the edges of the bowl clean. BPA-free silicone is scratch-resistant, stain-resistant, and food-safe for the best possible kitchen tool. The soft-touch silicone will not scratch pans, making it a gentle and safe choice for nonstick and cast iron cookware in addition to your jars, blenders, and other small spaces. Silicone is heat resistant up to 600 degrees Fahrenheit. Made of BPA-free silicone and wood.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nQkq6RykL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tovolo","source_asin":"B088PMZQCB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1153513","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088PMZQCB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088PMZQCB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1153514,"name":"Cuisipro Stainless-Steel Measuring Cups and Spoon Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41K28DPJCML._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description The perfect gift! A box set of 5 stainless steel measuring spoons and 4 stainless steel measuring cups. Sleek, oval design with long handles, comfortably reaches into spice jars or tall containers. Each nested cups and spoon set comes with convenient storage clip to keep them together. Thick, flat rims make it easy to level your cups with a knife. Gently curved handles allow the spoons to sit securely on the counter without tipping over. Dishwasher safe. 1 set of cups and spoons; 1/4, 1/3, 1/2, 1 cup and 1/8, 1/4, 1/2, 1 tsp, 1 tbsp. Model: 74-7143 Amazon.com This set of four measuring cups and five measuring spoons are a must-have for regular bakers. Both are made of heavyweight 18/10 stainless-steel for durability and long-lasting use. The measuring cups are useful for larger quantities of dry ingredients, such as flour, sugar, and beans, while the measuring spoons handle ingredients in smaller quantities, such as salt, spices, and baking powder. The measuring cups can even be used right on the stovetop to melt butter or chocolate. The unique oval shape of both the measures and the spoons is specifically designed for dipping into narrow bags and jars and pulling out ingredients, and the thick rims make it easy to level off your scoop with either a knife or a finger. The gradual measuring cups come in sizes of ¼-, ½-, ¾-, and 1 cup and are held together by a stainless-steel ring looped through the handles. The spoons come in sizes of 1/8-, ¼-, ½-, and 1 teaspoon and 1 tablespoon and are also linked together with a ring. These tools are all dishwasher-safe for easier cleanup and are covered by a lifetime warranty. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41K28DPJCML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuisipro","source_asin":"B000HSC8FK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1153514","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000HSC8FK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000HSC8FK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1153515,"name":"Portable Air Conditioner Window Kit with Coupler,Adjustable AC Window Vent Kit,Universal Window Seal Kit with 5.9 Inches Hose Suitable Horizontal&Vert","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61F565wc1YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Portable Air Conditioner Window Kit】The portable AC window kit includes four panels,each 17 feet long,with adjustable lengths ranging from 25 inches to 64 inches,for a 5.9-inch diameter exhaust hose. Next, we include four screw fittings, a round bore interface,a 5.5-inch diameter filter panels,a 6.5-foot diameter roll of foam tape, and a 4-inch diameter roll of cloth-based tape.The product great for LG,Haier, and other air-conditioning accessories. 【Easy to install】Our portable air conditioner window kit simply nest the panels together,slide them to the desired length,secure them with screws and finally fix it in the window frame,easy to operate and with excellent cost performance,it is your essential choice. 【Double sealing】This air conditioning ventilation kit comes with a roll of foam tape and fabric-based tape. Firstly, the air conditioning panel is fitted, using foam tape on both sides of the panel, and then fitted to the window, thus reducing wear and tear and strengthening the seal; secondly, cloth-based tape is applied to the joint between the air conditioning panel and the window to enhance insulation and further seal 【Filtering Function】Our portable ac window kit have added Strainer inside the circular opening to block some unwanted guests, thus making your room constantly flooded with clear and cool air, the ventilation kit can seal open windows and prevent hot air from returning,while saving electricity,making your air conditioning unit more efficient and cooling your room in a shorter time.enjoy a cool environment in summer。 【Durable】The window vent kit of the portable AC device is made of high-quality PVC, which is resistant to extrusion and aging, and can be used year after year. Simple and stable fixing method, easy to install and disassemble. Convenient storage, saving space, suitable for use at home or office. 【Wide Range of Applications】This portable sliding door air condition kit suitable for vertical or horizontal sliding windows or sliding doors,not applicable to casement windows.You can choose two-combination,three-combination or four-combination according to the size of the window. Can meet your needs for various scenes of use","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61F565wc1YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DARCKLE","source_asin":"B09QC6ZYSG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1153515","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QC6ZYSG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QC6ZYSG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
