window.products.push({"id":1153522,"name":"ZEKE Tools 8 Inch Damascus Chef Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51G8V+cVOkL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"ZEKE 8 INCH DAMASCUS CHEFS KNIFE  Everybody needs one good knife. This one will be yours.   ZEKEtools is proud to offer our first product. This 8 inch gyuto style chef's knife is handmade. The blade is forged from layers of 1095 and 15n20 High carbon tool steels. Both steels are excellent at holding an edge, the 15n20 has a higher nickel content. When the two steels are repeatedly folded and pressure welded together, the unique Damascus pattern comes out. Every knife will be slightly different. The blade is hardened to approximately 58 HRC, and comes with a sharp factory edge. The handle is a sealed, durable olive-wood. This knife is functional and looks great doing it.   MODEL: ZDCK-1 - 8\" CHEF'S - CARE AND FEEDING   You know how to wash a knife... But I will implore you to not dump your knife into a sink of soapy water. Wash it carefully and individually. Always dry it off completely, and put it back where it belongs right away. Any water that sits on the knife can cause corrosion, and compromise the sharpness. Optionally, a thin layer of a quality food safe oil on the blade will keep your knife looking and performing great even longer. A sharp knife is safer, and satisfying to use. A good knife sharpener would probably do the job. A quality whetstone for sharpening and a steel for honing would probably do it better. Up to you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51G8V+cVOkL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZEKEtools","source_asin":"B00P9JPWUA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1153522","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00P9JPWUA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00P9JPWUA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
