window.products.push({"id":1153551,"name":"Swiss Woven Brocade 27x14” Oval Table Runner, Dresser Scarf or Table Topper with Decorative Fabrics and Artfully Embroidered with Lavish Floral and Go","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gJEtaEv2L._AC_.jpg","description":"Our Swiss made family of Brocade table runners, table scarves, doilies, and placemats are beautiful enough to be displayed by themselves or to accent lamps, picture stands, and your collectibles. Designed with a rose pattern in the center, surrounded by an elegant repeating pattern, and a metallic gold border. You can see the beautiful detail in our close-up pictures. According to Wikipedia, Brocade “comes from Italian broccato meaning ‘embossed cloth.’\" Brocade textiles are very dense, fine fabrics made of delicate threads which obtain an elegant, shiny, sophisticated and embroidery-like surface through the integration of silk threads, metal threads or luxury yarns with the Jacquard loom and weaving process. Our Brocade table accents bring Old World elegance into your contemporary home. Each piece is made from high-quality European fabric, Made of 79% Rayon Viscose, and 17% Lurex, using the Jacquard loom and weaving technique. Dry clean only. Woven in Switzerland in the traditional manner with rich metallic gold color detail. Our Brocade accents have a lavish floral design with a metallic gold color border, and to protect your furniture the reverse side is finished with a soft backing. Both beautiful and practical our Brocades will add elegance to any room in your home or office.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gJEtaEv2L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sana Enterprises","source_asin":"B01N7JGIEY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1153551","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N7JGIEY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N7JGIEY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
