window.products.push({"id":1153561,"name":"Comfort Zone CZ465EBK 750/1,500-Watt Oscillating Digital Ceramic Heater, Energy Save Smart Heat Control, Electronic Thermostat, Safety Overheat Protec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-1celNyEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It always pays to be practical. That’s why a lot of folks use space heaters when the colder months roll in. Doing so can help offset the additional costs on your utility bill. However, it’s similarly important to remember that not all space heaters are made equal. For all you know, your heating device that’s supposed to save you some dollars might actually be costing you money instead. But don’t worry, there is a solution. We have designed a personal heater that provides your heating needs while being as efficient as possible in energy consumption. Even better, you can get it here and now. Stay warm the cost-effective way with the Comfort Zone Energy Save Oscillating Ceramic Heater! Keeping your room toasty doesn’t have to mean a sky-high electricity bill. That’s why we’ve created this space heater! Equipped with the powerful Energy Save technology, this 750W/1500W warmer can generate up to 5120 BTUs of heat while consuming 30% less power. It’s the ideal choice for warming up a small room. With our ceramic heater, you are in control of how warm you want your living space to be. It has an adjustable thermostat alongside 3 heat settings as well as a fan-only mode. Fine-tune the settings to your liking and maintain that comfortably cozy atmosphere in your home. Most importantly, our oscillating ceramic heater is built with your safety in mind. It has a molded handle and a body that stays cool while in operation. And that’s on top of its safety tip switch and overheat protection. Learn more about our product here: - One (1) oscillating ceramic heater - 120V, 5 ft cord length - Comes with a molded handle for easy carrying - Stay cool body while in use - ETL approved for the United States and Canada Make the practical choice for your heating needs. Add the Comfort Zone Energy Save Oscillating Ceramic Heater to your cart NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-1celNyEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Comfort Zone","source_asin":"B09FWYF4SH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1153561","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FWYF4SH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FWYF4SH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
