window.products.push({"id":1153810,"name":"hoyiours Digital Meat Thermometer, Waterproof Instant Read Food Thermometer for Cooking with Foldable Probe, Backlight and Magnet, Kitchen Thermometer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tnCtAM9QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Instant Reading: Digital meat thermometer with probe measures accurate data in less than 3 seconds with a range of -58°F ~ +572°F (-50°C ~ 300°C) and easily switches between °F and °C to your liking with an accuracy of ±2°F (±1°C), keeping you away from undercooked food and overcooked food. Cooking thermometer is calibrated, allowing you to calibrate and reset when needed Backlight and LCD Display: Instant read meat thermometer has has a large, bright LCD display with a 10s backlight and 180° auto-rotating readout to help you read and easily understand the temperature of your food, even in dimly lit areas without the need for additional light; the \"hold\" button locks the temperature reading for 10s, protecting your hands from potential burns Easy to Clean: With waterproof meat thermometer, you can clean the digital food thermometer for cooking under running water to keep the food thermometer clean and tidy. Digital thermometer for cooking features a sturdy ABS plastic body that reduces damage caused by accidental drops or bumps, extending the life of the product Easy to Use: Collapsible cooking thermometer has a 4.7-inch probe that flips out to open and simply flips back in to close when not in use. Digital cooking thermometer for meat automatically turns off in about 10 minutes without operation, and a low battery indicator reminds you to replace the batteries to prevent power outages from affecting your cooking process Widely Used: Digital food thermometer with built-in magnet and hanging hole, suitable for kitchen, cooking, baking, roasting, milk, ice cream, water, tea, coffee, soup, etc. Thermometer cooking has hanging hole and strong magnet, you can put the food thermometer in the drawer, stick it on the refrigerator or hang it on the wall hook","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tnCtAM9QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"hoyiours","source_asin":"B0BC1PB1CJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1153810","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BC1PB1CJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BC1PB1CJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
